WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.010
In 2024, the world's population
grew by about 0.96 percent.

2
00:00:06.060 --> 00:00:10.270
Japan's population fell by 0.44 percent.

3
00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:13.730
Its fourteenth year of decline in a row.

4
00:00:13.780 --> 00:00:16.110
Yet Tokyo's population rose.

5
00:00:16.160 --> 00:00:20.650
It had the highest rate of
increase of all 47 prefectures.

6
00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:21.290
Growing.

7
00:00:21.340 --> 00:00:22.290
Shrinking.

8
00:00:22.340 --> 00:00:23.310
Growing.

9
00:00:23.360 --> 00:00:24.990
Which is the true story?

10
00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:27.530
The world's figure,
because it covers everyone?

11
00:00:27.580 --> 00:00:31.510
In this mission, you'll zoom from the
whole world down to single places,

12
00:00:31.560 --> 00:00:34.390
and compare what each zoom shows.

13
00:00:34.440 --> 00:00:37.270
Then you'll test each figure
against real decisions,

14
00:00:37.320 --> 00:00:39.430
like where to build new housing.

15
00:00:39.480 --> 00:00:42.850
Your mission: decide
which is the true story:

16
00:00:42.900 --> 00:00:45.640
the world's, Japan's or Tokyo's.
